{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KjRGruiazYLQUgnEAdy6MK","type":"tool_result","content":"# CNCF Curriculum Repository Overview\n\n## Available PDF Files\n\nThe repository contains the following curriculum PDFs:\n\n- KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCAD_Curriculum_v1.35.pdf\n- CKA_Curriculum_v1.35.pdf\n- CKS_Curriculum v1.34.pdf\n- CGOA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CAPA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CBA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CNPA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CNPE_Curriculum.pdf\n- CCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- ICA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCSA Curriculum.pdf\n- OTCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- PCA_Curriculum.pdf\n\n**Note:** The KCNA file listed does not include a version number in its filename, unlike some other certifications.\n\n## Version Management\n\nThe repository explains its versioning approach: \"The document major and minor version (e.g., the 1 and 8 in 1.8.0) match the version of Kubernetes. The patch version (e.g., the 0 in 1.8.0) represents any iterations in the documentation for that version of Kubernetes.\"\n\nThe repository also notes that \"Old versions remain available\" for reference purposes."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ba44a35-dfac-469b-9317-2d811c689d53","uuid":"5b0092a6-9bf0-4914-a2be-fe39f3f0a316","timestamp":"2026-08-24T03:48:45.880Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":306594,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CNCF Curriculum Repository Overview\n\n## Available PDF Files\n\nThe repository contains the following curriculum PDFs:\n\n- KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCAD_Curriculum_v1.35.pdf\n- CKA_Curriculum_v1.35.pdf\n- CKS_Curriculum v1.34.pdf\n- CGOA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CAPA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CBA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CNPA_Curriculum.pdf\n- CNPE_Curriculum.pdf\n- CCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- ICA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- KCSA Curriculum.pdf\n- OTCA_Curriculum.pdf\n- PCA_Curriculum.pdf\n\n**Note:** The KCNA file listed does not include a version number in its filename, unlike some other certifications.\n\n## Version Management\n\nThe repository explains its versioning approach: \"The document major and minor version (e.g., the 1 and 8 in 1.8.0) match the version of Kubernetes. The patch version (e.g., the 0 in 1.8.0) represents any iterations in the documentation for that version of Kubernetes.\"\n\nThe repository also notes that \"Old versions remain available\" for reference purposes.","durationMs":4584,"url":"https://github.com/cncf/curriculum"}}
