{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SbuA118j3TQH83D1i9YH2t","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CNCF KCNA exam update November 2025 domain changes announcement observability rolled under architecture\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"KCNA Upcoming Changes 2025\",\"url\":\"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/kcna-program-changes/\"},{\"title\":\"Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/kcna/\"},{\"title\":\"Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) - Linux Foundation - Education\",\"url\":\"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certification/kubernetes-cloud-native-associate/\"},{\"title\":\"Cloud Native Certifications | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/\"},{\"title\":\"Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) Program Changes - Linux Foundation - Education\",\"url\":\"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certified-kubernetes-administrator-cka-program-changes/\"},{\"title\":\"Cilium Certified Associate (CCA) | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/cca/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - hammadhaqqani/awesome-devops-ai: A curated list of 474 AI tools, agents, MCP servers, and resources for DevOps, SRE, and Platform Engineering — updated July 2026\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/hammadhaqqani/awesome-devops-ai\"},{\"title\":\"Prometheus Certified Associate (PCA) | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/pca/\"},{\"title\":\"Training & Certification | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/training/\"},{\"title\":\"Kubernetes is evolving, the CKA exam too! | CNCF\",\"url\":\"https://www.cncf.io/blog/2024/09/05/kubernetes-is-evolving-the-cka-exam-too/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the CNCF KCNA exam updates:\n\n## KCNA Exam Domain Changes\n\nThe KCNA domains will remain mostly unchanged except that observability will be rolled under Cloud Native Architecture. Any KCNA exam taken after the updated release will test on the new set of Domains and Competencies.\n\n## Important Exam Date Information\n\nIt does NOT matter if the exam reservation happens to be for a first attempt or a retake, nor does it matter on what date you completed the exam purchase. The only date that matters is the date you sit for the exam.\n\nThe official announcement was published by the Linux Foundation Training team, indicating these changes are part of their ongoing efforts to keep the KCNA certification aligned with the evolving Kubernetes and cloud-native ecosystem.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ba44a35-dfac-469b-9317-2d811c689d53","uuid":"9d3961c0-44b6-4035-ad95-296854464489","timestamp":"2026-08-24T03:50:37.090Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CNCF KCNA exam update November 2025 domain changes announcement observability rolled under architecture","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CGQ4EihvWFxSpfYaULjFFU","content":[{"title":"KCNA Upcoming Changes 2025","url":"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/kcna-program-changes/"},{"title":"Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/kcna/"},{"title":"Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) - Linux Foundation - Education","url":"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certification/kubernetes-cloud-native-associate/"},{"title":"Cloud Native Certifications | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/"},{"title":"Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) Program Changes - Linux Foundation - Education","url":"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certified-kubernetes-administrator-cka-program-changes/"},{"title":"Cilium Certified Associate (CCA) | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/cca/"},{"title":"GitHub - hammadhaqqani/awesome-devops-ai: A curated list of 474 AI tools, agents, MCP servers, and resources for DevOps, SRE, and Platform Engineering — updated July 2026","url":"https://github.com/hammadhaqqani/awesome-devops-ai"},{"title":"Prometheus Certified Associate (PCA) | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/pca/"},{"title":"Training & Certification | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/"},{"title":"Kubernetes is evolving, the CKA exam too! | CNCF","url":"https://www.cncf.io/blog/2024/09/05/kubernetes-is-evolving-the-cka-exam-too/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found information about the CNCF KCNA exam updates:\n\n## KCNA Exam Domain Changes\n\nThe KCNA domains will remain mostly unchanged except that observability will be rolled under Cloud Native Architecture. Any KCNA exam taken after the updated release will test on the new set of Domains and Competencies.\n\n## Important Exam Date Information\n\nIt does NOT matter if the exam reservation happens to be for a first attempt or a retake, nor does it matter on what date you completed the exam purchase. The only date that matters is the date you sit for the exam.\n\nThe official announcement was published by the Linux Foundation Training team, indicating these changes are part of their ongoing efforts to keep the KCNA certification aligned with the evolving Kubernetes and cloud-native ecosystem."],"durationSeconds":5.245839199999987,"searchCount":1}}
