{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SPZFw2F4ESJhSGkp9iYx7L","type":"tool_result","content":"# KCNA Exam Version Information\n\n**Update Timeline:**\n\"The Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) exam will be updated no earlier than November 24, 2025.\"\n\n**Determining Which Exam Version Applies:**\n\"It does NOT matter if the exam reservation happens to be for a first attempt or a retake, nor does it matter on what date you completed the exam purchase. The only date that matters is the date you sit for the exam.\"\n\n**What Will Be Tested After Update:**\n\"Any KCNA exam taken after the updated release will test on the new set of Domains and Competencies.\"\n\n**Note on Current Studying Guidance:**\nThe page does not contain explicit guidance directed to candidates currently studying for the exam."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ba44a35-dfac-469b-9317-2d811c689d53","uuid":"86bd759b-ae4e-4feb-98df-c2882d24e2ba","timestamp":"2026-08-24T03:50:49.480Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":7279,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# KCNA Exam Version Information\n\n**Update Timeline:**\n\"The Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) exam will be updated no earlier than November 24, 2025.\"\n\n**Determining Which Exam Version Applies:**\n\"It does NOT matter if the exam reservation happens to be for a first attempt or a retake, nor does it matter on what date you completed the exam purchase. The only date that matters is the date you sit for the exam.\"\n\n**What Will Be Tested After Update:**\n\"Any KCNA exam taken after the updated release will test on the new set of Domains and Competencies.\"\n\n**Note on Current Studying Guidance:**\nThe page does not contain explicit guidance directed to candidates currently studying for the exam.","durationMs":2771,"url":"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/kcna-program-changes/"}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0118D5dPKr2Cgu4JPiLXvPVx","type":"tool_result","content":"# CNCF Certifications List\n\nThe page does not explicitly group certifications by level, but presents them in this order:\n\n## Professional/Specialist Level (Hands-on)\n- **Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA)**: \"performance-based exam where candidates interact with the command line to solve real-world challenges\"\n- **Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD)**: \"hands-on, command-line environment\"\n- **Certified Kubernetes Security Specialist (CKS)**: \"performance-based\" exam\n- **Certified Cloud Native Platform Engineer (CNPE)**: \"performance-based, hands-on exam\"\n\n## Associate/Entry Level\n- **Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA)**: \"online and multiple-choice\"\n- **Kubernetes and Cloud Security Associate (KCSA)**: entry-level credential\n- **Prometheus Certified Associate (PCA)**: foundational knowledge certification\n- **Istio Certified Associate (ICA)**: \"online, proctored, performance-based exam\"\n- **Cilium Certified Associate (CCA)**: entry-level certification\n- **Certified Argo Project Associate (CAPA)**: associate-level certification\n- **GitOps Certified Associate (CGOA)**: certification for DevOps professionals\n- **Certified Backstage Associate (CBA)**: skills validation credential\n- **OpenTelemetry Certified Associate (OTCA)**: foundational expertise credential\n- **Kyverno Certified Associate (KCA)**: certification for Kubernetes expertise\n- **Cloud Native Platform Engineering Associate (CNPA)**: associate-level certification\n\nThe page notes KCNA \"lays the groundwork for further CNCF certifications like CKA, CKAD, and CKS.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6ba44a35-dfac-469b-9317-2d811c689d53","uuid":"90abf4c1-c4a5-488c-bc06-85b2aa5d88f6","timestamp":"2026-08-24T03:50:53.857Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":182009,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CNCF Certifications List\n\nThe page does not explicitly group certifications by level, but presents them in this order:\n\n## Professional/Specialist Level (Hands-on)\n- **Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA)**: \"performance-based exam where candidates interact with the command line to solve real-world challenges\"\n- **Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD)**: \"hands-on, command-line environment\"\n- **Certified Kubernetes Security Specialist (CKS)**: \"performance-based\" exam\n- **Certified Cloud Native Platform Engineer (CNPE)**: \"performance-based, hands-on exam\"\n\n## Associate/Entry Level\n- **Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA)**: \"online and multiple-choice\"\n- **Kubernetes and Cloud Security Associate (KCSA)**: entry-level credential\n- **Prometheus Certified Associate (PCA)**: foundational knowledge certification\n- **Istio Certified Associate (ICA)**: \"online, proctored, performance-based exam\"\n- **Cilium Certified Associate (CCA)**: entry-level certification\n- **Certified Argo Project Associate (CAPA)**: associate-level certification\n- **GitOps Certified Associate (CGOA)**: certification for DevOps professionals\n- **Certified Backstage Associate (CBA)**: skills validation credential\n- **OpenTelemetry Certified Associate (OTCA)**: foundational expertise credential\n- **Kyverno Certified Associate (KCA)**: certification for Kubernetes expertise\n- **Cloud Native Platform Engineering Associate (CNPA)**: associate-level certification\n\nThe page notes KCNA \"lays the groundwork for further CNCF certifications like CKA, CKAD, and CKS.\"","durationMs":5232,"url":"https://www.cncf.io/training/certification/"}}
